                                "sense_id": "c76c317a-9d6f-38bd-acc9-571bb4ac5e78",
                                "text": "She's careful about her smell, her looks; and true, a lot of Lisa is only what you see on the surface, and even that surface layer is covered in scent, splathered in suntan lotion, and she even hides her original accent, […]"
                            },
