                                "sense_id": "c76c317a-9d6f-38bd-acc9-571bb4ac5e78",
                                "text": "[T]oday it's double helpings of Mexican sausage and American scrambled eggs, with hot sauce splathered on Sampson's, buttered toast also for him, two muffins for me, and some fruit for us to pocket for later."
